--> logback.xml vs logback-spring.xml
    | Feature          | logback.xml | logback-spring.xml |
    | ---------------- | ----------- | ------------------ |
    | Spring profiles  | ❌ No        | ✅ Yes              |
    | Property support | ❌ Limited   | ✅ Full             |
    | Recommended      | ❌           | ✅                  |

    Always use logback-spring.xml

